    "year": 2023,
    "description": "𝕃𝕪𝕔𝕠𝕣𝕚𝕤𝕖𝕤 is a series of generative artworks inspired by Ernst Haeckel‘s illuminating illustrations on biological evolutions. Combining the visual language of microscopic organisms and flowers, the Lycorises artworks aim to represent the intricacies of life and how it constantly evolves.  \nEach color palette reflects the unique structure of 𝕃𝕪𝕔𝕠𝕣𝕚𝕤𝕖𝕤 specifically evolved in its environments, including the volcano, alien desert, or cyberspace.  These environments encouraged the growth of characteristic features, such as spikes, feathers, and leaves, that protect the Lycoris seed.",
